  "description": "Tracer Bora Lightweight Women's Beach Cruiser Bike, 26 Inch Wheels\n\nHybrid Bike for Adults combines the features of a comfort bike, a commuter bike and a cruiser bike.\nHigh-density foam grips on the wide handlebars, a dual spring cushioned wide seat that ensures tailbone comfort on long rides.\nEasy to assemble 85% comes assembled.\n\nFRAME\n\nTracer Hi-ten steel Classical 26*16\"\n\nFORK\n\nTracer Hi-ten Steel 3/8\"*22.2*25.4*167*367*102mm\n\nSHOCK\n\nN/A\n\nHANDLEBAR\n\nTracer Steel Moon-Type 680*22.2*1.4T\n\nSTEM\n\nAlloy 22.2*25.4*180mm Heavy Duty, Ext:80mm\n\nPEDALS\n\nOne-piece PP\n\nSHIFTERS\n\nN/A\n\nFRONT DERAILLEUR\n\nN/A\n\nREAR DERAILLEUR\n\nN/A\n\nBRAKE\n\nV Brakes\n\nBRAKE LEVERS\n\nN/A\n\nCASSETTE\n\n20T\n\nCHAIN\n\nC410 1/2\"*1/8\"*114L\n\nCRANKSET\n\nAlloy/Steel 1/2*1/8*44T, Crank Arm Length: 165mm\n\nBOTTOM BRACKET\n\nSteel for One Piece Cranks\n\nRIMS\n\nWide:29mm 26*1.75*36H*14G, Black\n\nFRONT HUB\n\nSF-HB03F, 3/8\"*14G*36H*100*140mm\n\nREAR HUB\n\nLC-201R coaster, 3/8*14G*36H*110*150mm\n\nSPOKES\n\nStainless Steel 14G gauge\n\nTIRES\n\nBlack, white wall, 26\"x2.125\n\nFENDERS\n\nN/A\n\nMEAS\n\n139*18*68cm\n\nEXTRAS\n\nCustom designed rear alloy rack, reflectors, steel kickstand\n\nWEIGHT\n\nThe most accurate way to determine any bike’s weight is to have your local dealer weigh it for you. Many brands strive to list the lowest possible weight, but in reality, weight can vary based on size, finish, hardware and accessories. All our bikes are designed for best-in-class weight and ride quality.",
